@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/labels

### List labels
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Get a label by id (INBOX always exists; use an id from the list for your own labels)
GET {{baseUrl}}/INBOX

### Get a label that doesn't exist (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/not-a-real-id

### Create a label (expect 201; run it twice to see 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "API test label" }

### Create with a blank name (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": " " }

### Rename a label (replace the id with one of your own labels from the list)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/Label_5
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "API test label renamed" }

### Rename a system label (expect 400 "Cannot update system label names")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/INBOX
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "My inbox" }

### Delete a label (expect 204; replace the id with one of your own labels from the list)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Label_5

### Delete a label that doesn't exist (expect 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Label_999

### Delete a system label (expect 400 "Invalid delete request")
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/CHAT

### Health check (expect "UP", including "gmail")
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
